spans.s:
प्र-कम्पन, अस्, ई, अम्, causing to tremble;
(अस्), m. wind, air; N. of a hell; of an Asura;
(अम्), n. great trembling, shaking, swaying to and
fro, violent or excessive motion.

प्रकल् प्र-कल् (see rt. 2. कल्), cl. 10. P.
-कालयति, -यितुम्, to drive onwards, chase, pursue;
to urge on, incite.

प्र-कीर्तन, अम्, n. announcing, proclaiming;
pronouncing aloud; praising aloud, lauding, extolling;
(आ), f. mentioning, naming.

प्र-कुर्वत्, अन्, अती, अत्, doing much or well;
behaving respectfully to, waiting upon, serving,
honouring.

प्र-कीर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, announced, proclaimed;
pronounced, declared, said, mentioned, stated; called,
named; explained; revealed; renowned, celebrated.

प्रक्रुश् प्र-क्रुश्, cl. 1. P. -क्रोशति, -क्रोष्-
टुम्, to raise a cry, cry out; to utter (cries), call;
to invoke, call upon, cry out to.
